OL,3,AMeghan's father Thomas Markle charged
OL,4,Aover possession of child sexual abuse
OL,5,Amaterial
OL,6,
OL,7,FThomas Markle, the father of Meghan,
OL,8,FDuchess of Sussex, has been charged
OL,9,Fover possession of child sexual abuse
OL,10,Fmaterial
OL,12,FThe 82-year-old was arrested in Florida
OL,13,Fand is due to appear in court later,
OL,14,Fthe Department of Justice says - Markle
OL,15,Fpreviously denied the allegations
OL,17,FIt comes after reports of his arrest
OL,18,Femerged earlier, and images published
OL,19,Fby news outlets appeared to show him in
OL,20,Fhandcuffs surrounded by FBI
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
